{"overview":"«سی.سی. بکستر» یک کارمند ساده است که در شرکت بیمه کار می‌کند. او برای بهتر شدن شرایط کاری و پیشرفت در آن، آپارتمان خود را در اختیار رؤسای بخشهای مختلف شرکت می‌گذارد تا آنها با معشوقه‌هایشان، ساعاتی را در آنجا مشغول باشند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Bud Baxter is a minor clerk in a huge New York insurance company, until he discovers a quick way to climb the corporate ladder. He lends out his apartment to the executives as a place to take their mistresses. Although he often has to deal with the aftermath of their visits, one night he's left with a major problem to solve.","tagline_en":"Movie-wise, there has never been anything like it - laugh-wise, love-wise, or otherwise-wise!","runtime":126,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["بیلی وایلدر"],"crew_en":["Billy Wilder"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"جک لمون","role":"C.C. Baxter","photo":"/7jWVWLr1VJqQrN3d4YJaATCIHRw.jpg","en":"Jack Lemmon"},{"name":"شرلی مک‌لین","role":"Fran Kubelik","photo":"/vU4QsP3GRj03S8Z92vrZfkdb7rO.jpg","en":"Shirley MacLaine"},{"name":"فرد مک‌موری","role":"Jeff D. Sheldrake","photo":"/lxxixlFMNH0JuA9K0K3mJmigYcc.jpg","en":"Fred MacMurray"},{"name":"Ray Walston","role":"Joe Dobisch","photo":"/pRVUmhdc9nxflBI5GJvokz0nPPb.jpg"},{"name":"Jack Kruschen","role":"Dr. Dreyfuss","photo":"/3QOPlFyLfFR8cLe0pseRjrm3lra.jpg"},{"name":"David Lewis","role":"Al Kirkeby","photo":"/nwEuF8nyeN7tlHL7GsJuVCOsmI7.jpg"},{"name":"Hope Holiday","role":"Margie MacDougall","photo":""},{"name":"Joan Shawlee","role":"Sylvia","photo":"/oUmK5YF1jcGs5eEGStI1I3iF5vd.jpg"},{"name":"Naomi Stevens","role":"Mrs. Mildred Dreyfuss","photo":"/3s8sSpWsA2iZr20Db47nEbTcAYo.jpg"},{"name":"Johnny Seven","role":"Karl Matuschka","photo":"/kn6k8OPk4OnAGl2aKp9zOBXfMyw.jpg"},{"name":"Joyce Jameson","role":"The Blonde","photo":"/wSkhDflX3GiIMx8AQx0gKKwxE9m.jpg"},{"name":"Willard Waterman","role":"Mr. Vanderhoff","photo":"/t0QsePvJiJgTvusWlS8exxXFwsj.jpg"}],"trailer":"ekDkUUPSWuY","watch":{"US":{"link":"h